        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "fe5c17ee-2375-3a82-be97-a15ca1cb6578",
                "word": "speleoloog",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "bae73277-a112-4730-ab12-857af900bfbd",
                        "entry_id": "fe5c17ee-2375-3a82-be97-a15ca1cb6578",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "speleologen"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7ffef27f-c892-3b1e-a94e-75ad0cde3888",
                        "entry_id": "fe5c17ee-2375-3a82-be97-a15ca1cb6578",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een onderzoeker van grotten en holen, kenner van de speleologie"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "beroep"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bee59e39-3194-407b-a107-7ab5388307c5",
                                "sense_id": "7ffef27f-c892-3b1e-a94e-75ad0cde3888",
                                "text": "In de duisternis, nauwelijks in staat een rilling te onderdrukken, kruipt Hideki achter Toru aan door wat op een onderaardse gang lijkt. Hij kan niet begrijpen hoe hij hier terecht is gekomen, het enige wat hij wil is met de trein naar huis. Als een verdwaalde speleoloog die zich richt op een sprankje ver daglicht volgt hij het dansende vlammetje van Toru's aansteker."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d8ff416-20b9-4bda-9298-668f843634a4",
                                "sense_id": "7ffef27f-c892-3b1e-a94e-75ad0cde3888",
                                "text": "Sharon glimlacht. 'En jij ziet zo bleek als het achterste van een speleoloog."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "64278dce-9575-4830-99f6-468c9199d73b",
                                "sense_id": "7ffef27f-c892-3b1e-a94e-75ad0cde3888",
                                "text": "De onderzoekers hopen hun nieuwe inzicht te kunnen gebruiken bij het ontwerpen van betere viool- en gitaarsnaren, touwladders en hefkabels voor reddingshelikopters, abseil-touwen voor bergbeklimmers en speleologen, lijnen voor parachutes. En verhuizers zouden het ook leuk vinden als die piano onderweg naar boven niet begint te draaien."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8960d009-05ce-4e25-9eff-ee2a6ca46ecd",
                                "sense_id": "7ffef27f-c892-3b1e-a94e-75ad0cde3888",
                                "text": "Vorig jaar zat elders in Duitsland een speleoloog lang vast in een grot. De onderzoeker liep op een kilometer diepte ernstig hoofdletsel op door een vallende rots, en werd pas na elf dagen bevrijd door reddingswerkers."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a5823649-6ee4-4c5b-9489-55c1de3bc9d8",
                        "source_entry_id": "fe5c17ee-2375-3a82-be97-a15ca1cb6578",
                        "source_sense_id": "7ffef27f-c892-3b1e-a94e-75ad0cde3888",
                        "source_sense_description": "holen en grotten onderzoeker",
                        "target_lang_word": "speleologist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "speleologist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aff61543-aecd-341c-8ef0-68b90c5999a1",
                                        "entry_id": "0c1de8a1-f736-3a8f-8597-637fbb0c0eb2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who studies or explores caves or studies the science of speleology."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b79da63c-5a2d-47d6-b0b6-f21c5ab9c564",
                                                "sense_id": "aff61543-aecd-341c-8ef0-68b90c5999a1",
                                                "text": "Under this heading M. E. A. Martel, the distinguished speleologist or cave-explorer of Europe, whose researches have recently added considerably to our knowledge of the Adelsberg grotto, furnishes to La Nature an interesting account of the episode in the Lueg-Loch or Lur-Loch, near the Styrian capital, which so nearly resulted fatally to the seven members of the Höhlenforscher—Fasching, Fölzmann, Zweyer, Oswald, Maier, Kurz and Haidt—who, on the 28th of April, attempted the exploration of the lost passage of the Semriach."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "407087f5-2908-46ba-9503-70dc2ef5193b",
                                                "sense_id": "aff61543-aecd-341c-8ef0-68b90c5999a1",
                                                "text": "The first man known to have descended Gaping Gill is well known on the Continent as an expert cave-explorer or speleologist — to use the new term which he perhaps invented."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b76f49ac-5823-4d54-ab14-0d55cc20a039",
                                                "sense_id": "aff61543-aecd-341c-8ef0-68b90c5999a1",
                                                "text": "The biography of Robert de joly, a famous French speleologist who spent his life exploring caves, revealed an experience in which he stumbled into some cave areas high in carbon dioxide (CO₂) and developed a severe headache lasting twenty-four hours."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d72978fa-eca4-42ef-98f4-671ddb6f47d8",
                        "source_entry_id": "fe5c17ee-2375-3a82-be97-a15ca1cb6578",
                        "source_sense_id": "7ffef27f-c892-3b1e-a94e-75ad0cde3888",
                        "source_sense_description": "holen en grotten onderzoeker",
                        "target_lang_word": "spelunker",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "spelunker",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ada230e-6e8f-382c-9fc2-d1ab8644de3c",
                                        "entry_id": "b9a63a24-dc98-361c-b4ca-27bd70bc3e0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who explores caves; one who spelunks."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canada",
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5407cf8-f27e-428e-8329-040d3d998f82",
                                                "sense_id": "6ada230e-6e8f-382c-9fc2-d1ab8644de3c",
                                                "text": "I took to fishing, on mountain brooks and lakes, and finally I was inveigled into becoming a spelunker. A spelunker is a human worm who crawls into caves (\"splunca\" is Latin for cave) and explores them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "45fbcb37-ed55-34bd-85be-13ad4a416659",
                                        "entry_id": "b9a63a24-dc98-361c-b4ca-27bd70bc3e0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An amateur or inadequately prepared caver."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94c619c9-f42a-4721-918c-0a91daba6298",
                                                "sense_id": "45fbcb37-ed55-34bd-85be-13ad4a416659",
                                                "text": "I am officially a spelunker – but not yet a caver. The dictionary definition of spelunking is “exploring caves for sport.” Serious enthusiasts shun the term, however. They are cavers. A spelunker is an inexperienced amateur. On this dry and balmy mid-November Saturday, our group contains three spelunkers and two cavers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffa5a1f9-e860-4eca-b703-9196ef5284e5",
                                                "sense_id": "45fbcb37-ed55-34bd-85be-13ad4a416659",
                                                "text": "But the scariest of all’s the witless caver;\nSpelunker is the name that he goes by.\nHe caves alone with just one light,\nA worn-out rope, and boots too tight,\nLooking for a cave in which to die."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1b96b30-398f-47b7-beba-a25c265db78e",
                                                "sense_id": "45fbcb37-ed55-34bd-85be-13ad4a416659",
                                                "text": "it is a truth that every caver was once a spelunker with a flashlight and a tangled ball of string."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cdbfba8e-381f-457e-872b-32b44af119da",
                                                "sense_id": "45fbcb37-ed55-34bd-85be-13ad4a416659",
                                                "text": "“‘Cavers,’” the editor notes, “generally consider ‘spelunkers’ to be people who have no real knowledge or understanding of caves and caving safety, but who decide to enter a cave anyway, usually without proper equipment.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
